&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The Old Covenant priesthood, embodied by Aaron and his lineage, was a shadow of the glorious reality to come. It was a physical representation, but our true access to God comes through a superior arrangement, for all believers are now a royal priesthood:
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;1 Peter 2:9 (NIV): &quot;But you are a chosen people, a royal priesthood, a holy nation, God’s special possession, that you may declare the praises of him who called you out of darkness into his wonderful light.&quot;
